    648  f062							; EnterRoomB2 (C2 2026-10-20: b6 of the room's RoomShapes byte; the
    649  f062							; 2026-10-04 up-exit fix). The
    650  f062							; old per-frame VBL fold that re-read the same ROM byte is
    651  f062							; REDUNDANT since then and is deleted (2026-10-19): it saved nothing the
    652  f062							; kernel needs, cost ~30c of VBL time, and it was a level-data read in
    653  f062							; the VBL path (the read that made a bank3 data move need another
