    747  f0b7							; Was inline between VBL-tail and .Row: making it a jsr'd KernelInit
    748  f0b7							; added ~19c + an entry WSYNC to the cycle-precise VBL-tail→.Row span
    749  f0b7							; → wall 263→264 every frame. Inits live HERE (window headroom
    750  f0b7							; 1472-1076 ≈ 396c, cost ~25c) so the entry span SHRINKS vs inline.
    751  f0b7							; HUD cannot clobber these: HUD runs AFTER the kernel each frame.
