   2000  f54d		       b0 3e		      bcs	CEHNext	; no X overlap
   2001  f54f		       85 8b		      sta	CollisionX	; keep x-overlap span for lamp's narrower box
   2002  f551							; Y overlap: player [RoomY, +11] vs enemy [ActiveObjectY, +11] — exact
   2003  f551		       a5 81		      lda	RoomY
