   2652  f805							; SOSkipTail — the rotation slot picked a DEAD enemy (or a taken key). It used
   2653  f805							; to draw nothing, so the survivor showed only every 2nd frame: kill the enemy
   2654  f805							; next to the miner and the MINER started flickering (user 2026-10-25), and a
   2655  f805							; two-enemy room flickered its survivor. Hand the slot on instead:
   2656  f805							;   1. the miner is here -> draw the miner (every frame once the enemy is gone);
   2657  f805							;   2. else the room's other enemy (index ^ 1) if it exists and is alive;
   2658  f805							;   3. else nothing.
   2659  f805							; Terminates: step 2 jumps into the live path only for a LIVE partner, and a
   2660  f805							; taken key can re-enter here only once per frame (its partner is then dead).
