   4095  fdde							; lives in bank0 ($F9F5 region), so the VBL `jsr PickPlayerFrame` resolves
   4096  fdde							; in-bank and the 6-byte `sta $1FF6 / jmp $F3C4` pad plus its bank2 mirror
   4097  fdde							; are gone. PlayerWalkA/B flow up to $FDDE (nothing pins them any more).
