   4101  fdde							; PlayerWalkA/B — dedicated ground-walk frames (sprites.png 2026-10-03,
   4102  fdde							; extracted pixel-exact; torso rows 0-6 identical to the jet pair).
   4103  fdde							;   A = boots apart (stride, rows 10-11 spread to cols 2+6 / 1+6)
   4104  fdde							;   B = boots together (passing pose, rows 10-11 = cols 3+4)
   4105  fdde							; Legs rows 7-9 identical in both — only the boots move. Standing forces
   4106  fdde							; PlayerSpriteA; walk cycle alternates A<->B every 8 frames (EnemyRamP&$08,
   4107  fdde							; 16-frame full cycle) while grounded + L/R held.
